{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/Soma-Nigel-Forest-STEAM_1_.png?t=1742595654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dream Runner is a heartwarming, 2D adventure platformer following Soma's story of self-reflection as he's forced to master newfound abilities in order to save his lost best friend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/A_Whimsical_Adventure_small.png?t=1742595654\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-crafted pixel art world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth, &quot;flow-state&quot;, precision platforming focused on comboing abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of self-reflection as you venture deeper into the Dreamscape to rescue a lost friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain and combine powerful abilities that transform how you navigate the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and venture through hidden paths as you move through each biome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your platforming abilities to the test in a flurry of post-game challenge levels in Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/Library_Hero_Steam_Clipping_Mask.png?t=1742595654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/About-Section-Gif-2x.gif?t=1742595654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035870?t=1742595654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035870?t=174